# QUICKREF — Universal AI Quick Reference Guide
Floor: 2
Thrust: 9
Patch: 0
File: openOODA/QUICKREF.oot

This document provides a syntax cheat sheet, capability matrix, architectural overview, and operational rules.

## 1. The 3-Tier Architectural Hierarchy & Model

The openOODA system operates across three unified architectural tiers:

┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      3-TIER ARCHITECTURAL MODEL                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
